  description: A demon borned in the midst of a violent snow storm. They are weak
    and lowly ranked among monsters. They reside in extremely cold regions, and only
    appear during harsh chilly seasons when the lands are covered in ice and snow.
    Children who had seen them call them the "mystical bouncing snowman".
